	(text "TLV62569: VIN and EN on +5V (after the fuse on the RP2040 sheet). 2.2 uH, 10 uF in, 2x 10 uF out.\nFeedback 100k/22k: Vout = 0.6 V x (1 + 100/22) = 3.33 V. Keep the SW node and L1 away from\nthe thermocouple inputs."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 30.48 0)
